mapping "W3363.1" source="W3363" target="218081007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W3363 SNOMED CT 218081007 = Swedish 7-char extension of ICD-10 W33 (Rifle, shotgun and
        larger firearm discharge) adding place (industrial site/construction site) and activity (other
        activity). Target SNOMED CT 437167 (concept_code 218081007), the verified Athena target for parent
        W33 (ICD10 concept_id 45756286). Place/activity axes have no SNOMED CT representation; the clinical
        core (rifle/shotgun/larger firearm discharge accident) is fully captured. Broader: target
        subsumes source (every W3363 event is a firearm-missile accident). High : one-level broader,
        parent crosswalk verified in Athena mirror.
        """
}
